    {
      "id": "wep-intro",
      "type": "text",
      "html": "<p>Weapon categories distribute damage types against a tri-attribute counter system, so players adapt and swap rather than lock into one loadout.</p>"
    },
    {
      "id": "flex-h",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "How I kept it flexible"
    },
    {
      "id": "flex",
      "type": "pillars",
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "Composite damage distribution",
          "body": "Every weapon outputs a staggered percentage of all damage attributes, so no enemy type becomes a hard progression block."
        },
        {
          "label": "Non-restrictive specialisation",
          "body": "Investment paths allow deep specialisation into a damage vector while preserving basic weapon versatility."
        }
      ]
    },
